      "rule": "Per invoice: Paid if balance<=0; else Overdue if due < today (Overdue beats Partial); else Partial if paid>0; else Upcoming. Days overdue = today - due for Overdue rows, blank otherwise. (A zero-amount row shows Paid - matches the family idiom in reference product 07.)",
